stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Reading
    Reading --> CommandCheck: line read (fresh entry)
    CommandCheck --> Exit: quit / q / exit
    CommandCheck --> Reading: help / clear / .env / .type / .save
    CommandCheck --> Accumulate: ordinary line
    Reading --> Accumulate: continuation line
    Accumulate --> Reading: unclosed bracket, string or comment
    Accumulate --> Build: balanced (interp_repl_session_eval)
    Build --> Reading: INCOMPLETE (parser needs more)
    Build --> Rollback: REJECTED (parse, type, plan, T0 support)
    Build --> Execute: plan, link, snapshot slab
    Execute --> Rollback: FAILED (error or fault, Ctrl-C included)
    Rollback --> Reading: restore scope, lists, index, source, slab
    Execute --> Echo: OK (fragment only, nothing replayed)
    Echo --> Reading: value, unless declarations or statements only
    Exit --> [*]
